{"body":{"from":[{"$ref":"1M72V32949Z6023"},{"$ref":"1M72V32949Z606K"}],"opens":"In order, each step grounding the next. First, agents read through the engine by a CLI: an agent gives an expression in the language as it stands, the natives with level and a whole read to a depth, and a local engine over the store folders answers; the next session's own bootstrap is its first use, the roots measured, the wiki whole, the last two sessions in full and only what is graded three before them; the probe and read tools then stand on the engine, so there is one way of reading. Second, patterns, each store's integration answering a pattern's clauses, glass's from an index of arrays, grounded by what the CLI is actually asked; expressions stay calls, so the CLI does not change beneath it; order rides on values. Third, the reader says where one is, by the same functions. Fourth, glass's store ships its index, and the lexicon becomes a function. Pinned: time and at, streams, programs. The next session begins at the first step.","restsOn":["Expressions are calls, functions give three ways","A pattern of facts, the low language of functions","A store answers patterns","Order among facts"],"stands":"let go"},"id":"1M72V32949Z60AN","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000007"],"name":"The plan from here"}
